DESCRIPTION >
    Narrow activation-marker ledger for request-time identity joins. It keeps
    activation gating indexable by batch without scanning the full journal.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String),
    `batch_version` UInt64,
    `batch_id` String,
    `committed_at` DateTime64(6),
    `row_hash` FixedString(64)

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, batch_version, batch_id, committed_at, row_hash
ENGINE_SETTINGS "index_granularity=128"
